sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-brassica-oleracea-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-brassica-oleracea-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-brassica-oleracea-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Brassica oleracea Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 172 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 77.1/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 1 overall 77.14. The script solves Schnakenberg kinetics so the fastest Turing mode is 172 µm on a 4128 µm patch (24 waves), with an equal-diffusion ablation and a six-point D_v sweep. Modal growth rates match linear theory (Pearson r = 0.9999999522, RMSE = 0.0036). The nonlinear sweep only reaches r = 0.83 because of Fourier binning, and the specimen photograph is a macro curd, so specimen-match and parameter-expressivity stay below the Pass 2 bar. Overall 77.1/100 (faithfulness 75.3, reproducibility 81.5); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: python 3.12.3, numpy 2.5.4, scipy 1.18.1, matplotlib 3.11.2, Pillow 13.0.0. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 82, Morphological realism / specimen match 74, Parameter expressivity 70, Morphometric validation 72, Source and data traceability 86, Code-to-model traceability 78, Reproducibility package 80. Output judged: docs/media/brassica_oleracea_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-brassica-oleracea-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 697207 B, 1344×1008 px, artifact_sha256 febada1318b9e5a6db50dda52257067810cf7e7ff0ffdd998737e9b9de014e9c (sha256 febada1318b9e5a6db50dda52257067810cf7e7ff0ffdd998737e9b9de014e9c), spec_fingerprint eace5cd4a6194a1b662909a5f49a87e8ba4e22bd4a0f6438065b99d8328eb65a. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: eace5cd4a6194a1b662909a5f49a87e8ba4e22bd4a0f6438065b99d8328eb65a; artifact_sha256: febada1318b9e5a6db50dda52257067810cf7e7ff0ffdd998737e9b9de014e9c; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/brassica_oleracea_turing_wavelength_s0/README.md=40b5ed77e35bfbbd..., datasets/brassica_oleracea_turing_wavelength_s0/brassica_oleracea_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=1cbb4e4e7defa706..., datasets/brassica_oleracea_turing_wavelength_s0/brassica_oleracea_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=7306e7e95f1cbecc..., datasets/brassica_oleracea_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=2bbca9157437d615..., datasets/brassica_oleracea_turing_wavelength_s0/scout_manifest.json=6b0322cfb4700c55...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 dispersion relation | Schnakenberg 1979 quadratic autocatalysis | Azpeitia et al. 2021 floral-network account of Romanesco cones (a different mechanism); reconstructed_in_script: sigma(k) and D_v solved for lambda = 172 µm | Modal growth-rate comparison on modes k = 1..6; transfer_boundary: 172 µm is the slot scale, not a spacing measured by Azpeitia or Duclos; does_not_claim: That the studio photograph resolves 172 µm | That Schnakenberg species are the Brassica morphogens." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Keep the nonlinear D_v-sweep Pearson r (0.8266) and its RMSE in the measurement note, separate from the modal dispersion r (0.9999999522). Do not replace the binned sweep with the modal statistic.",
            "remediation needed: Re-run image fitness after that split and score specimen-match from the measured cv_sim_similarity (88.4) plus the non-circular curd circularity.",
            "remediation needed: State in the claim boundary that the gallery photograph is a macro curd and that 172 µm is the slot scale, not an Azpeitia measurement." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.771"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (MorphoEval loop 3137 Pass 1)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://x.ai> .
}

